message.content:
ブロック崩し、完成しました。スコア・レベル・残機・ハイスコアを備えたアーケード風の一画面版です。ブロック破壊で粒子が散り、段差やエッジに当たる角度でボールが加速し、ブロックが残り少ないとパドルが短くなります。

キーボード（← → または A D）でもマウスでも打てます。

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>ブロック崩し · BRICKBREAK</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Chakra+Petch:wght@500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#0a0a12; --ink:#f4f1ea; --muted:#8b90ab;
    --line:rgba(255,255,255,.08); --amber:#ffb703; --mint:#38d9a9;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html,body{margin:0}
  body{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; color:var(--ink);
    background:var(--bg); min-height:100vh; overflow-x:hidden;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }

  /* ---- layered background ---- */
  .bg{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;overflow:hidden}
  .bg .grad{position:absolute;inset:-20%;
    background:
      radial-gradient(45% 40% at 15% 12%, rgba(255,89,107,.14), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(40% 40% at 85% 8%, rgba(56,217,169,.12), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(60% 50% at 70% 90%, rgba(83,109,254,.15), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(50% 45% at 30% 80%, rgba(255,183,3,.10), transparent 60%);
  }
  .bg .grid{position:absolute;inset:0;
    background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.03) 1px,transparent 1px),
                     linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,.03) 1px,transparent 1px);
    background-size:34px 34px;
    -webkit-mask:radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 20%,#000 40%,transparent 85%);
            mask:radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 20%,#000 40%,transparent 85%);
  }
  .bg .scan{position:absolute;inset:0;
    background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(0,0,0,.14) 0,rgba(0,0,0,.14) 1px,transparent 1px,transparent 3px);
    opacity:.5;mix-blend-mode:multiply}
  .bg .vig{position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(130% 110% at 50% 40%,transparent 55%,rgba(0,0,0,.6))}
  .floaters{position:absolute;inset:0}
  .floaters i{position:absolute;bottom:-40px;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:2px;
    opacity:.5;animation:float linear infinite}
  @keyframes float{to{transform:translateY(-112vh) rotate(120deg);opacity:0}}

  /* ---- shell ---- */
  .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:26px 22px 50px}

  header.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:24px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:22px;animation:rise .7s both}
  .brand h1{margin:0;font-family:'Chakra Petch',sans-serif;font-weight:700;
    font-size:clamp(34px,6.2vw,68px);line-height:.92;letter-spacing:-.02em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .brand h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--amber)}
  .brand h1 .o{color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:2px rgba(255,255,255,.28)}
  .brand .kicker{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
  .brand .kicker b{color:var(--mint)}
  .hilo{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .chip{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;padding:8px 13px;border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:9px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.025)}
  .chip span{font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
  .chip b{font-family:'Chakra Petch',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--amber)}

  .stage{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.55fr) minmax(250px,1fr);gap:22px;align-items:start}
  .stage>*{animation:rise .7s both}
  .stage .cabinet{animation-delay:.06s}
  .stage .side{animation-delay:.14s}
  @keyframes rise{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}

  /* ---- cabinet ---- */
  .cabinet{position:relative;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#161622,#0d0d16);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-radius:20px;padding:16px;
    box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.05),0 34px 70px -22px rgba(0,0,0,.75)}
  .cabinet::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:10px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);
    width:44px;height:4px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--amber);
    box-shadow:0 0 14px 2px rgba(255,183,3,.8);animation:blink 2.4s ease-in-out infinite}
  @keyframes blink{0%,100%{opacity:.55}50%{opacity:1}}
  .cabinet-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:2px 6px 13px}
  .cab-title{font-family:'Chakra Petch',sans-serif;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.05em;font-size:13px}
  .cab-title .dim{color:var(--muted)}
  .live{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--muted)}
  .live .dot{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--mint);
    margin-right:7px;box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--mint);animation:blink 1.3s infinite;vertical-align:middle}

  .screen-wrap{position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:560/680;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;
    background:#07070f;cursor:none}
  #game{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block;touch-action:none}
  .screen{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:5;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;text-align:center;padding:26px;
    background:linear-gradient(rgba(7,7,15,.82),rgba(7,7,15,.93));
    -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(3px);backdrop-filter:blur(3px);
    transition:opacity .35s,transform .35s}
  .screen.hide{opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transform:scale(1.03)}
  .screen-tag{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.28em;color:var(--amber);margin-bottom:10px}
  .screen h2{font-family:'Chakra Petch',sans-serif;font-weight:700;margin:0;
    font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,52px);letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1;text-transform:uppercase}
  .screen p{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;max-width:34ch}
  .screen p b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}
  .screen p .g{color:var(--mint)}
  .screen .big{font-family:'Chakra Petch',sans-serif;font-weight:700;color:var(--amber);font-size:40px;margin:12px 0 2px}
  .screen .sub{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}
  .screen .sub .hi{color:var(--amber)}

  .btn{margin-top:22px;font-family:'Chakra Petch',sans-serif;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:14px;color:#1a1200;background:var(--amber);border:none;
    padding:13px 26px;border-radius:11px;cursor:pointer;
    box-shadow:0 12px 26px -10px rgba(255,183,3,.7);transition:transform .12s,filter .2s}
  .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);filter:brightness(1.08)}
  .btn:active{transform:translateY(0)}
  .hint{margin-top:15px;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--muted)}
  .hint kbd{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:2px 6px;color:var(--ink)}

  /* ---- side panel ---- */
  .side{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
  .card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:16px 18px;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.022)}
  .card .lbl{font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
  .card .val{font-family:'Chakra Petch',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;
    line-height:1;color:var(--amber);font-size:clamp(40px,7.2vw,58px)}
  .card .val.bump{animation:bump .3s}
  @keyframes bump{0%{transform:scale(1)}40%{transform:scale(1.14);color:#fff}100%{transform:scale(1)}}
  .grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px}
  .mini{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;padding:12px 14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.022)}
  .mini .lbl{font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
  .mini .v{font-family:'Chakra Petch',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:23px;margin-top:5px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .mini.lives .v{color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:1px}

  .combo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;
    padding:13px 15px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.022)}
  .combo .lbl{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
  .combo b{font-family:'Chakra Petch',sans-serif;font-size:20px;color:var(--amber)}
  .combo .bar{flex:1;height:6px;border-radius:6px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);overflow:hidden}
  .combo .bar i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;border-radius:6px;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ff8fa3,var(--amber));transition:width .2s}

  .card h3{margin:0 0 13px;font-family:'Chakra Petch',sans-serif;font-weight:600;
    font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
  .key{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted)}
  .key kbd{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink);background:#191926;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13);border-bottom-width:3px;border-radius:7px;padding:5px 9px;min-width:26px;text-align:center}

  .ctl{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .tbtn{flex:1;min-width:82px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;padding:11px 10px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;
    transition:background .2s,border-color .2s}
  .tbtn:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.18)}
  .tbtn.active{border-color:var(--mint);color:var(--mint)}

  footer{margin-top:34px;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;letter-spacing:.04em}
  footer b{color:var(--amber)}

  @media(max-width:840px){.stage{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
